en_district,_Madhya_Pradesh,_India_ggia_version.jpg","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Woman harvesting wheat, Raisen district, Madhya Pradesh, India."},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2012-03-20"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Yann\" title=\"User:Yann\">Yann Forget</a>"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}}}]},{"pageid":65309365,"title":"File:Woman of Bolivarian Armed Forces in a presidential meeting.jpg","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/Woman_of_Bolivarian_Armed_Forces_in_a_presidential_meeting.jpg/960px-Woman_of_Bolivarian_Armed_Forces_in_a_presidential_meeting.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Woman_of_Bolivarian_Armed_Forces_in_a_presidential_meeting.jpg","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Military Police Woman in a presidential meeting. <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Bolivarian_Armed_Forces_of_Venezuela\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:National Bolivarian Armed Forces of Venezuela\">National Bolivarian Armed Forces</a> and Revolutionary army, are used as personal protection for the president in public meetings. Red color in the meetings is traditionally associated with socialism in Venezuela, in this case, the red platform occupied the front of the Chiquinquirá Basilica."},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2012-12-20 15:17:49"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Wilfredor\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"User:Wilfredor\">Wilfredor</a>"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}}}]},{"pageid":88752360,"title":"File:Woman sewing a face mask with a Singer machine 09.jpg","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Woman_sewing_a_face_mask_with_a_Singer_machine_09.jpg/960px-Woman_sewing_a_face_mask_with_a_Singer_machine_09.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Woman_sewing_a_face_mask_with_a_Singer_machine_09.jpg","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Woman hands sewing a home-made medical face protective mask with a Singer Ideal Model 1014 sewing machine due to the resolution of the Government of the Czech Republic (no. 106/2020 Coll.) about the obligation of wearing any kind of respiratory protection in reaction to the 2020 coronavirus pandemic in Czechia (lots of Czech family members and volunteers thus embarked on making their own face masks)."},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2020-03-21 18:46:09"},"Artist":{"value":"<bdi><a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q99692082\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"d:Q99692082\"><span title=\"Czech photographer and chronicler\">Tadeáš Bednarz</span></a></bdi>"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}}}]},{"pageid":89635330,"title":"File:Wolfsspinne Trochosa Rose-20190905-RM-081613.jpg","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Wolfsspinne_Trochosa_Rose-20190905-RM-081613.jpg/960px-Wolfsspinne_Trochosa_Rose-20190905-RM-081613.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wolfsspinne_Trochosa_Rose-20190905-RM-081613.jpg","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Wolf Spider (Pardosa hortensis) between the leaves of a rose blossom in a garden in Bamberg. Focus stack of 19 images."},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2019-09-05 08:16:13"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Ermell\" title=\"User:Ermell\">Ermell</a>"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}}}]},{"pageid":122117452,"title":"File:Woman Baby Mane Spiti Jun18 DSC05475.jpg","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Woman_Baby_Mane_Spiti_Jun18_DSC05475.jpg/960px-Woman_Baby_Mane_Spiti_Jun18_DSC05475.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_c